<!--
SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Marc Jose <marc@hahn-jose.de>
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

The shaders of frames on the graphics card, baked by tools/shaders.sh. A name of its own: rcc
names the function that registers them after the file, and the resources that cxx-qt-build
lists for each crate all get the same names.
-->
<RCC>
  <qresource prefix="/kudari/shaders">
    <file>glyph.vert.qsb</file>
    <file>glyph.frag.qsb</file>
  </qresource>
</RCC>
